  "id": "behind-the-scenes-s01e05-scene-26",
  "pair": "zh-en",
  "title": "是你先背叛他  (You Were the One Who Betrayed Him?)",
  "level": "A1 — beginner",
  "labels": {
    "xin_huimei": "辛惠美"
  },
  "segments": [
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Over evening drinks with Luo Lin, Xin Huimei vents about Chun Yuqiao's domineering style at Xingtian, until an angry slip of the tongue from Luo Lin reveals a shocking truth about their past breakup. Listen to Huimei in Mandarin first.",
      "gap": 0.8
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "淳于乔这种自大的人，我见得多了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "他总觉得自己能够操控台前幕后的一切。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这种人你要是不教训一下他，他会越来越放肆的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我这么做也不光是为了帮你出气。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "请我去星光盛典，我觉得这也不是他的主意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "自从李铭基出事以后，电视台一直派人盯着星天，两边的关系非常紧张。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "淳于乔的坏名声已经传出去了，在星天也不好混了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我想如果有人要请我上节目，他也不能一手遮天吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "那当年他离开以前的卫视，想必是得罪了全台的人吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "等一下，你说什么？你背叛他了？",
      "gap": 0.9
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's go through it line by line with the English translation.",
      "gap": 0.5
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "淳于乔这种自大的人，我见得多了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Arrogant men like Chun Yuqiao are something I have seen plenty of.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "他总觉得自己能够操控台前幕后的一切。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'He always thinks he can control everything onstage and behind the scenes.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "这种人你要是不教训一下他，他会越来越放肆的。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'If you do not teach someone like that a lesson, he only grows more reckless.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我这么做也不光是为了帮你出气。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I did not do all that solely to stand up for you.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "请我去星光盛典，我觉得这也不是他的主意。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Inviting me to the Star Night gala was not his idea either, I think.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "自从李铭基出事以后，电视台一直派人盯着星天，两边的关系非常紧张。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Ever since Li Mingji's incident, the network has had people watching Xingtian, and ties are tense.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "淳于乔的坏名声已经传出去了，在星天也不好混了。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Chun Yuqiao's bad reputation has already spread, making life hard for him at Xingtian too.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "我想如果有人要请我上节目，他也不能一手遮天吧。",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'I figure if someone wants to invite me onto a show, he cannot block everything single-handedly.'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "那当年他离开以前的卫视，想必是得罪了全台的人吧？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Back when he left his old network, he must have offended everyone at the station, right?'",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "等一下，你说什么？你背叛他了？",
      "gap": 0.55
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "'Wait a second — what did you say? You betrayed him?'",
      "gap": 0.65
    },
    {
      "v": "narrator",
      "t": "Now let's listen to the whole conversation one last time.",
      "gap": 0.75
    },
    {
      "v": "xin_huimei",
      "t": "淳于乔这种自大的人，我见得多了。",
      "gap": 0.5
